{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/orzmc\/releasemacos"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC\/ReleaseMacOS","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OrzMC"}],"role":"article","title":"macOS 发布流程","roleHeading":""},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%89%8D%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87","level":2,"text":"发布前准备"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"钥匙串中已安装 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Developer ID Application"},{"type":"text","text":" 证书。"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已创建 Apple "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"notarytool"},{"type":"text","text":" 钥匙串配置。"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已准备 Sparkle EdDSA 私钥，可以存放在钥匙串或文件中。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"可选：GitHub CLI 已登录，用于上传 Release 资产。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"首次创建 "},{"code":"notarytool","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 配置："}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["xcrun notarytool store-credentials \"orzmc-notary\" \\","  --apple-id \"APPLE_ID_EMAIL\" \\","  --team-id \"2N62934Y28\" \\","  --password \"APP_SPECIFIC_PASSWORD\""]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%A1%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83","level":2,"text":"一条命令发布"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE=orzmc-notary \\",".\/scripts\/release-macos.sh"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"脚本会从 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMC\/Configuration\/Config.xcconfig"},{"text":" 读取 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MARKETING_VERSION"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION"},{"text":"，然后生成：","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dist\/macos\/<version>-<build>\/...zip"},{"text":"：用于 Sparkle 更新。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"dist\/macos\/<version>-<build>\/...dmg","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"：用于直接下载。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"products\/appcast.xml","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"：用于 Sparkle 更新源。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82","level":2,"text":"运行要求"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"当前公开 macOS 版本要求：","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"macOS 14.0 Sonoma 或更新版本。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Apple Silicon 或 Intel Mac。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"首次获取版本清单、下载资源和 Sparkle 更新需要网络连接。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"启动所选 Minecraft Java Edition 版本需要兼容的 JDK。应用会检测已安装 JDK 的主版本，并可在需要时下载匹配版本。","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"维护时需要保持以下位置一致：","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMC.xcodeproj\/project.pbxproj"},{"type":"text","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET = 14.0"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"products\/appcast.xml"},{"type":"text","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sparkle:minimumSystemVersion"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"DocC 中面向用户的安装要求说明","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9","text":"常用选项"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["DEVELOPER_ID_APPLICATION=\"Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)\"","APPLE_TEAM_ID=TEAMID","NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE=orzmc-notary","SPARKLE_ED_KEY_FILE=\/path\/to\/sparkle_private_key","RELEASE_NOTES_FILE=\/path\/to\/release-notes.md","PUBLISH_GITHUB=1","DERIVED_DATA_PATH=DerivedData"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"仅做本地打包验证、不进行公证：","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["SKIP_NOTARIZE=1 .\/scripts\/release-macos.sh"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKIP_NOTARIZE=1"},{"type":"text","text":" 只用于本地验证。公开下载的构建必须完成公证并装订公证票据。"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"GitHub-Release-%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0","text":"GitHub Release 上传"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"默认情况下，脚本只准备本地产物并更新 appcast。要上传 Release 资产："}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash","code":["PUBLISH_GITHUB=1 \\","NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE=orzmc-notary \\",".\/scripts\/release-macos.sh"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"默认仓库是 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzGeeker\/OrzMCApp"},{"type":"text","text":"，默认发布标签是 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MARKETING_VERSION"},{"type":"text","text":"，与现有 appcast URL 保持一致。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"GitHub-Actions","level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":".github\/workflows\/release-app.yml","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 会调用与本地相同的发布脚本。工作流会导入 Developer ID 证书，复用 DerivedData 和 SwiftPM 缓存，并设置："}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["APPLE_TEAM_ID","APPSTORE_PRIVATE_KEY","APPSTORE_KEY_ID","APPSTORE_ISSUER_ID","SPARKLE_ED_PRIVATE_KEY","GH_TOKEN","DERIVED_DATA_PATH=DerivedData","RESIGN_EXPORTED_APP=1","PUBLISH_GITHUB=1"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CI 公证使用的 "},{"code":"APPSTORE_PRIVATE_KEY","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"code":"SPARKLE_ED_PRIVATE_KEY","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 都是 Base64 编码后的文件内容。本地发布可以继续使用 "},{"code":"NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"code":"SPARKLE_ED_KEY_FILE","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"脚本上传 Release 资产后，工作流会把 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"products\/appcast.xml"},{"text":" 提交回仓库，保持现有 Sparkle 更新源地址可用。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Actions 先使用 Xcode 的 Developer ID archive\/export 路径完成导出，然后执行脚本侧二次签名。二次签名会先签内部 dylib、framework、XPC 和子 app，最后对最外层 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".app"},{"type":"text","text":" 做一次 bundle 签名，并追加一次最终 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--deep"},{"type":"text","text":" 签名兜底。排障时可临时设置 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RESIGN_EXPORTED_APP=0"},{"type":"text","text":" 跳过二次签名，用来区分 Xcode 导出签名与脚本侧重签的差异。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"脚本侧二次签名默认使用完整的 Developer ID Application 证书名称，而不是 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"security find-identity"},{"type":"text","text":" 返回的 SHA-1 hash。这样与 Xcode archive\/export 的签名身份格式保持一致，也便于发布后通过 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"codesign -d --extract-certificates"},{"type":"text","text":" 复验证书链是否嵌入公开产物。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"CI 会把 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEVELOPER_ID_KEYCHAIN"},{"text":" 指向导入 Developer ID 证书的临时 keychain。脚本侧重签会把该 keychain 显式传给 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"codesign --keychain"},{"text":"，避免 runner 上存在多个 keychain 或同名证书时解析到不完整的签名身份。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Release workflow 固定使用原生 Apple Silicon ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"macos-26"},{"text":" runner，并显式选择 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/Applications\/Xcode_26.3.app"},{"text":"。当前分发策略继续使用 GitHub hosted CI 产物作为正式 ZIP、DMG 与 Sparkle appcast 来源。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"需要注意：该 runner 产物在本机 macOS 26.4.1 严格复验时曾出现 "},{"code":"Authority=(unavailable)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"code":"Info.plist=not bound","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"code":"arm64 invalid signature","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"。出于自动化分发需求，当前仍保留 CI 发布链路；每次 CI 发布后仍需下载公开 ZIP\/DMG 做基础复验：校验 sha256、执行 "},{"code":"hdiutil verify","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"、确认 "},{"code":"lipo -archs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 包含 "},{"code":"x86_64 arm64","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"，并记录 "},{"code":"codesign","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"spctl","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 结果。如果用户侧反馈 Gatekeeper 无法打开，再切回本机或 self-hosted macOS 26.4.1 发布。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"缓存 key 包含 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"runner.arch"},{"type":"text","text":"，避免 Intel 与 Apple Silicon 的 DerivedData、SPM artifact 混用。Intel 兼容性不依赖 runner 架构，而必须在发布验证中确认产物本身保持 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x86_64 arm64"},{"type":"text","text":" universal binary。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%BA%90%E6%89%98%E7%AE%A1","level":2,"text":"更新源托管","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"应用当前读取的 Sparkle 更新源：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["https:\/\/raw.githubusercontent.com\/OrzGeeker\/OrzMCApp\/main\/products\/appcast.xml"],"syntax":"text","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"这个地址可用，但 GitHub Pages 或 CDN 更适合作为发布基础设施。如果后续迁移更新源 URL，需要更新 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMC\/Common\/Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SUFeedURL"},{"type":"text","text":"，并在大多数用户完成升级前保持旧更新源可访问。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81","level":2,"text":"发布验证","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"发布脚本会执行：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["codesign --verify --deep --strict --all-architectures","xcrun stapler validate","hdiutil verify","spctl --assess --type execute"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"脚本会校验导出的 app、解包后的 Sparkle ZIP，以及挂载后的 DMG 内部 app，并要求 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"codesign -dv --verbose=4"},{"type":"text","text":" 输出包含 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist entries="},{"type":"text","text":"，拒绝 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"codesign -d --entitlements :-"},{"type":"text","text":" 报告的 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid entitlements blob"},{"type":"text","text":"，同时要求 Developer ID 签名中能提取到嵌入的证书链。公开构建还需要下载 ZIP\/DMG 到本机复验；如果没有通过这些检查，不要发布。"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"主应用当前没有启用 App Sandbox，也没有需要声明的签名权限，因此 Xcode target 不应配置空的 entitlements 文件。空 entitlements blob 在较新的 macOS 26.4.1 验签环境中会被报告为无效签名。"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"本项目的完整 macOS 启动器不通过 Mac App Store 分发，而是使用 Developer ID 签名、Apple 公证和 Sparkle 自动更新。"}],"references":{"doc://com.joker.OrzMC/documentation/OrzMC":{"url":"\/documentation\/orzmc","type":"topic","title":"OrzMC","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"}}}